<%# About Us Page %>
<div class="container my-5">
  <div class="text-center mb-4">
    <h1 class="fw-bold text-primary">About Hospital Logs</h1>
    <p class="text-muted fs-5">
      Simplifying healthcare management, one patient at a time.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="bg-light p-4 rounded shadow-sm">
    <p class="fs-5">
      Welcome to <strong>Hospital Logs</strong> — a simple patient management system
      designed to help healthcare professionals manage patient information effectively.
    </p>

    <p class="fs-5">
      The platform enables you to easily track patient details such as name, age, and profile picture,
      along with treatment timelines and admission history.
    </p>

    <h4 class="mt-4 text-primary fw-semibold">Key Features</h4>
    <ul class="list-group list-group-flush mb-4">
      <li class="list-group-item">
        <strong>Profile Management:</strong> Upload and manage patient photos for quick visual identification.
      </li>
      <li class="list-group-item">
        <strong>Diagnosis Tracking:</strong> Record, update, and review medical conditions with clarity.
      </li>
      <li class="list-group-item">
        <strong>Admission & Treatment Logs:</strong> Monitor when patients were admitted and track care urgency.
      </li>
      <li class="list-group-item">
        <strong>Category Filtering:</strong> Sort patients by age, condition severity, or treatment time.
      </li>
      <li class="list-group-item">
        <strong>Search & Filter Tools:</strong> Quickly locate patients using names, diagnoses, or custom filters.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <p class="fs-5">
      Built with <strong>Ruby on Rails</strong> and <strong>Ubuntu CMD</strong> on Visual Studio Code,
      Hospital Logs follows CRUD principles for efficient data management.
    </p>

   

    <!-- Project Video Section -->
    <div class="text-center mt-5">
